# Package-scoped exception to the repo-root `build/` ignore rule: `apps/desktop/build/` holds
# the build's own TypeScript and its tests. They are first-class source, not generated artifacts,
# so this narrow un-ignore re-admits the desktop one.
!build/

# Package-scoped build-artifact ignore for `apps/desktop/out/`, the emit target for two generators:
#   • The renderer composite project's `tsc -b` pass writes to `out/tsc-renderer/` (its
#     `compilerOptions.outDir` in `src/renderer/tsconfig.json`).
#   • electron-vite's renderer bundle and main/preload chunks land under `out/` per its default
#     layout.
#
# The leading slash anchors the rule to the package root (parallel to `!build/` above) so a stray
# `out/` lower in the tree doesn't match. The repo-root .gitignore covers `dist/` and
# `node_modules/` but not `out/`, so this rule keeps the artifact-vs-source ignore policy local to
# the package that produces the artifact.
/out/
